          "commentable": false,
          "text": "Review MealScale for iPhone Duo: the sandbox node did the scripted work.\n\n## Capturas\n\nEspacios en el Duo abierto, antes y después (español, claro):\n\n![storage-areas-es.jpg](/files?path=files/images/f18bd4958342c6de0a39c568829f02b8228033fb0166cd7f16811de4a10e9dc8.jpg)\n\nInglés, oscuro y claro:\n\n![storage-areas-en.jpg](/files?path=files/images/39e1d803f5a6eff402d6dffcf70aa5fd57aebfbc83da5d9f985624931dc4c675.jpg)\n\nCompartir junto al «+» con el Duo plegado:\n\n![share-folded-es.jpg](/files?path=files/images/1f1abbacab6821ce0f5888002a9b0905383a1313bfb6baa0671d1ac630350e93.jpg)\n\nBienvenida plegada, antes y después:\n\n![welcome-folded.jpg](/files?path=files/images/55f24b895ae0a5f8736380722d0d6170d193feea9a2a5e54514b623dada2f934.jpg)\n\nCompra:\n\n![paywall.jpg](/files?path=files/images/7a8329da04ea21203f3ddd067970bd11ca1daae1330190be1021c775355bd450.jpg)\n\nCapturas de App Store del Duo: [en, abierto](https://github.com/acmecorp-private/MealScale/blob/8d0e5fb7edcc190633b9fc0b868f7051e48bc0f9/AppStore/screenshots/duo/en/iPhone_Duo_-_Night_Sky_-_Inner_Open_Landscape/01_unfold.png) · [es, abierto](https://github.com/acmecorp-private/MealScale/blob/8d0e5fb7edcc190633b9fc0b868f7051e48bc0f9/AppStore/screenshots/duo/es/iPhone_Duo_-_Night_Sky_-_Inner_Open_Landscape/01_unfold.png) · [en, plegado](https://github.com/acmecorp-private/MealScale/blob/8d0e5fb7edcc190633b9fc0b868f7051e48bc0f9/AppStore/screenshots/duo/en/iPhone_Duo_-_Night_Sky_-_Outer_Closed_Portrait/01_unfold.png) · [es, plegado](https://github.com/acmecorp-private/MealScale/blob/8d0e5fb7edcc190633b9fc0b868f7051e48bc0f9/AppStore/screenshots/duo/es/iPhone_Duo_-_Night_Sky_-_Outer_Closed_Portrait/01_unfold.png)\n\n![shot.png — GitHub no da acceso a acmecorp-private/not-a-repository](https://github.com/acmecorp-private/not-a-repository/blob/main/shot.png)",
